{"lyrics":"[00:00.00] [Instrumental Intro]\n[Intro: Jamie Foxx]\n[00:13.54] (Yo, Pi'erre, you wanna come out here?)\n[Chorus]\n[00:14.68] Hop on a Supermoto, do a burnout (Let's go, let's go, let's go, let's go)\n[00:17.18] Hundred twenty on the dash, bloody murder\n[00:20.06] Poppin', uh, wheelies, uh, I'm a quick learner (Skrrt)\n[00:23.50] Ridin' 'round with the burner\n[00:26.00] (Brrt, let's go)\n[00:27.34] Roamin' the streets, it's just me and the troops\n[00:29.10] I'm on a bike, 450 KTM, but gang, gang in the coupe\n[00:32.56] I bust a right, I bust a left at the end\n[00:34.70] I see the opps by the schoolyard\n[00:35.96] Grrah, grrah, grrah, grrah, grrah (Brrt, brrt, brrt, brrt, blaow)\n[Verse]\n[00:41.06] Y'all fuck niggas don't want no problem\n[00:43.90] Oh yeah, leave you dead, stinkin', rotten (Let's go)\n[00:47.38] Oh yeah, I took a risk, now I'm young and rich\n[00:49.46] Walk around in these kicks, Balenci' thе pair\n[00:51.38] Your B.F. a lame— (Square), he still livе in in the same— (Square)\n[00:54.78] Run up on me, a double dare (Dare)\n[00:57.20] I love watchin' my girl try on her underwear ('Wear)\n[01:00.36] \"This a high-class club, how you get a gun in here?\"\n[01:03.16] You can bet your fake Rolex I did\n[01:04.84] I ain't the only one strapped in here\n[01:06.68] You might just get shot by my engineer (Brrt-brrt)\n[01:09.22] Well, damn, on firearms, invested in like twenty grand\n[01:14.02] So many guns, we could start a gun marching band\n[01:17.72] FN, Smith & Wesson, Kel-Tec him (Oh-oh)\n[01:25.22] Should I kill 'em slow, slow, slow-ly?\n[01:29.54] Oh my, oh, me\n[01:32.88] Click-clack, hm, track, hm, meets (Brrrt)\n[Chorus]\n[01:36.52] Hop on a Supermoto, do a burnout (Skrrt-skrrt-skrrt)\n[01:39.02] Hundred twenty on the dash, bloody murder\n[01:42.34] Poppin', uh, wheelies, uh, I'm a quick learner (Skrrt)\n[01:45.96] Ridin' 'round with the burner (Brrt, let's go)\n[01:49.74] Roamin' the streets, it's just me and the troops\n[01:51.